  "title": "Master Challenge: Luxury Hotel & Smart Keys",
  "type": "build",
  "difficulty": "Advanced",
  "category": "Mastery",
  "scenario": "A Grand Hotel offers digital reservations. A Guest can \"Book Room\". Booking a room strictly «includes» \"Process Deposit\". When arriving, the Guest executes \"Check In\". During Check In, if the room is equipped with IoT locks, the system can optionally \"Issue Digital Key\" via «extend». The Hotel Receptionist participates as secondary actor in \"Check In\".",
  "goal": "Assemble the full diagram connecting Guest, Receptionist, Book Room, Process Deposit, Check In, and Issue Digital Key.",
  "learningObjective": "Demonstrate complete mastery of Use Case Diagrams: Actors, Boundaries, Associations, Include, and Extend.",
  "hints": [
    "Guest connects to \"Book Room\" and \"Check In\" via Association.",
    "\"Book Room\" includes \"Process Deposit\" (mandatory payment).",
    "Receptionist associates with \"Check In\".",
    "\"Issue Digital Key\" extends \"Check In\" (points from Issue Digital Key -> Check In)."
  ],
  "solutionExplanation": "Congratulations! You have mastered UML Use Case Diagrams from foundational actor-case associations to nuanced include and extend semantics.",
